    {
      "id": "p0264-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Surprisingly, the legacy of Underta/e's localization doesn't end here. Undertale continues to grow and change as Toby adds new content, which 8-4 continues to localize into Japanese. Toby and 8-4 also continue to collaborate with the Japanese game industry and the Japanese fan community long after Underta/e's Japanese release. They're also working more closely than ever on new projects like Deltarune, Toby's latest game creation.",
        "raw": "Surprisingly, the legacy of Underta/e's localization doesn't end here. Undertale\ncontinues to grow and change as Toby adds new content, which 8-4 continues\nto localize into Japanese. Toby and 8-4 also continue to collaborate with the\nJapanese game industry and the Japanese fan community long after Underta/e's\nJapanese release. They're also working more closely than ever on new projects\nlike Deltarune, Toby's latest game creation.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29026256,
          0.22994286,
          0.89782493,
          0.33466429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2868563,
          0.22922857,
          0.89985247,
          0.33573571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          9,
          10,
          11,
          12,
          13,
          14
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "令人惊喜的是，这份影响并未止步于此。Toby 不断为《Undertale》添加新内容，8-4 继续将其本地化为日语。日版发行很久以后，Toby 和 8-4 仍与日本游戏业及粉丝社区保持合作。他们也在 Toby 的新作《Deltarune》等项目上，比以往合作得更加紧密。",
        "status": "draft",
